ShutdownSystem illustrates StopRuntimeCleanly.
ShutdownSystem exercises ReliableServiceExchange.
ShutdownSystem starts-when ShutdownSystemReady.
ShutdownSystem starts-at ShutdownCheckBucking.
ShutdownSystemReady describes "Controlled offline shutdown requested; the allocated instance set and no-new-work phase must be established by the still-open lifecycle contract.".
ShutdownSystem preserves DurableFactsRetained.
ShutdownSystem specifies "Candidate walkthrough accounts for all nine registered Container lifecycles. It is not an adopted dependency order or parallel shutdown scheduler. Failure records remain pending while other cleanup is attempted. Software GlobalStop is a separate scenario that keeps diagnostics alive.".
ShutdownCheckBucking describes "Control-only selection of allocated BuckingService resources for this lifecycle phase; absence is not failure.".
ShutdownCheckBucking proceeds-to ShutdownRunBucking when ShutdownBuckingNeeded.
ShutdownCheckBucking proceeds-to ShutdownCheckBuckingWeb when ShutdownBuckingAbsent.
ShutdownRunBucking calls ShutdownServiceRuntime within BuckingService.
ShutdownRunBucking describes "Quiesce planning/commands and drain authoritative production/config outputs before releasing dependencies.".
ShutdownRunBucking proceeds-to ShutdownCheckBuckingWeb when ShutdownBuckingAccounted.
ShutdownRunBucking proceeds-to ShutdownCheckBuckingWeb when ShutdownBuckingFailed.
ShutdownBuckingNeeded describes "The allocation includes live resources for this phase.".
ShutdownBuckingAbsent describes "No allocated resources exist for this phase, or the same resources were already closed and accounted for.".
ShutdownBuckingAccounted describes "This phase completed with explicit resource/durable-output accounting.".
ShutdownBuckingFailed describes "This phase failed or exceeded its unresolved deadline; retain that result while attempting remaining cleanup. Error accumulation and retry are lifecycle-contract gaps.".
ShutdownCheckBuckingWeb describes "Control-only selection of allocated BuckingWeb resources for this lifecycle phase; absence is not failure.".
ShutdownCheckBuckingWeb proceeds-to ShutdownRunBuckingWeb when ShutdownBuckingWebNeeded.
