ShutdownAssess proceeds-to ShutdownSuccess when ShutdownAllAccounted.
ShutdownAssess proceeds-to ShutdownIncomplete when ShutdownHasUnresolvedResources.
ShutdownAllAccounted describes "All allocated resources, including renderer/tool instances, have an accepted shutdown disposition and required durability is accounted for. Missing lifecycle rules cannot be treated as success.".
ShutdownHasUnresolvedResources describes "Any allocation, drain, timeout, close or durability result remains failed/unknown; preserve evidence for explicit recovery.".
ShutdownSuccess finishes ShutdownSystem with ShutdownSystemCompleted.
ShutdownIncomplete finishes ShutdownSystem with ShutdownSystemIncomplete.
ShutdownSystemCompleted describes "All lifecycle obligations were accounted for under a future completed allocation contract; this outcome is not executable or demonstrated by this exercise.".
ShutdownSystemIncomplete describes "Report partial cleanup and unresolved resources; do not restore already closed sessions or erase committed records.".
